Hi Todd,

Thank you a lot for more feedbacks. In the current version of MSstatsTMT package, if the data has fractions, then you have to set fraction = TRUE. fraction = FALSE means there is no fractions in the dataset.

Current MSstatsTMT is our first version and as future work, we also plan to come up with better solution for fractionation problem. Your suggestion sounds good and I have put it in our todo list. We may add more options for fractionation problem in the next update of MSstatsTMT.

Best,
Ting

